# Distilled

Sam describes Distilled as providing Effect-native SDKs with tagged errors, including errors that provider specifications do not document. [Effect Office Hours 27, 55:19](https://youtu.be/fPSxB7ZgSJw?t=3319) [56:35](https://youtu.be/fPSxB7ZgSJw?t=3395).

This page records that public description. See [Effect Office Hours 27](/lore/effect-office-hours-27-alchemy-infrastructure-as-effects).
